listing.description_text:
Površina: 34 m2;

Kupatila: 1;

Namješten studio u zgradi Zeta, u okviru luksuznog kompleksa Porto Montenegro.

Stan se sastoji od prostranog otvorenog dnevnog boravka, kuhinje sa trpezarijom i kupatila.

Budući vlasnici koristiće spoljni bazen, teretanu, recepciju, obezbjeđenje i usluge konsijerža dostupne 24/7.

Porto Montenegro je marina svjetske klase sa ekskluzivnim rezidencijama, prodavnicama, hotelima itd. Svaka zgrada ima recepciju 24 sata, upravljanje objektom, obezbjeđenje, zajednički bazen, teretanu itd.

listing.description_text_en:
Area: 34 m2;

Bathrooms: 1;

Furnished studio apartment in Zeta building, within the luxury complex Porto Montenegro.

The apartment consists of a spacious open living room, kitchen with dining area and bathroom.

Future owners will have access to the outdoor swimming pool, gym, reception, security, and concierge services available 24/7.

Porto Montenegro is a world-class marina resort with exclusive residences, retail shops, hotels etc. Each building has a 24-hour reception, facility management, security, communal pool, gym, etc.
